      229.25,
      364.65,
      252.59
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO AMEND THE TELECOMMUNICATION LEVYACT, NO. 21 OF 2011",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.29,
      265.25,
      396.49,
      288.59
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.29,
      301.25,
      396.59,
      336.59
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the TelecommunicationLevy (Amendment) Act, No. of 2015, and shall come intooperation on April 1, 2015.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.29,
      349.25,
      396.5,
      408.59
    ],
    "text": "2.Section 2 of the Telecommunication Levy Act,No. 21 of 2011 (hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipalenactment\u201d) as last amended by Act, No. 11 of 2014 ishereby further amended by the repeal of that section and thesubstitution therefor of the following:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      157.29,
      421.25,
      396.51,
      504.59
    ],
    "text": "\u201c2.(1) There shall be charged and levied from everyperson receiving any telecommunication service(hereinafter referred to as \u201cthe recipient\u201d), a levy calledTelecommunication Levy, (hereinafter referred to as\u201cthe Levy\u201d), on the value of the supply of thetelecommunication services provided by the operator to thatrecipient in respect of each month\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.13,
      517.25,
      396.47,
      552.59
    ],
    "text": "(a)for the period commencing on or after January1, 2011 but prior to January 1, 2013, at therate of twenty per centum;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      197.13,
      565.25,
      396.47,
      588.59
    ],
    "text": "(b)for the period commencing on or after January1, 2013 but prior to January 1, 2014\u2013",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      223.29,
      601.25,
      396.47,
      624.59
    ],
    "text": "(i)at the rate of ten per centum, on thevalue of supply of internet services; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      220.29,
      637.25,
      396.58,
      672.59
    ],
    "text": "(ii)at the rate of twenty per centum, on thevalue of supply of telecommunicationservices other than the internet services;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
