  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      224.83,
      427.01,
      402.09,
      475.31
    ],
    "text": "(ii)for postpaid services at the rate oftwenty five per centum, on the value ofsupply of telecommunication servicesother than the internet services,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.83,
      488.57,
      402.21,
      598.31
    ],
    "text": "(2) There shall be charged and levied from everyoperator providing telecommunication service, other thaninternet service as a pre-paid service to any recipient, thelevy referred to in subsection (1) for any period commencingon or after April 1, 2015, until such date or period as may bespecified by the Minister under section 2A at the rate oftwenty five per centum, on the value of supply of suchtelecommunication service to that recipient in respect ofeach month.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.83,
      611.57,
      402.11,
      672.11
    ],
    "text": "(3) Where any such date or period is specified for thepurposes of subsection (2), the Levy shall be charged fromevery recipient of telecommunication service other thaninternet service, as a prepaid service, effective from that dateor period specified by the Minister.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
