      205.49,
      396.77,
      252.83
    ],
    "text": "(4) The provisions of subsections (1), (2) and (3), shallnot apply to any organization or any individual to whomthe provisions of the Diplomatic Privileges Act, No. 9 of1996 applies.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      157.17,
      265.49,
      396.74,
      300.83
    ],
    "text": "3.The following new section is hereby insertedimmediately after section 2 of the principal enactment andshall have effect as section 2A of that enactment:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      211.17,
      313.49,
      396.72,
      348.83
    ],
    "text": "2A. (1) The Minister may, by Order specifya date or period of the payment of the levyreferred to in subsection (2) of section 2.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      211.17,
      361.49,
      396.71,
      408.83
    ],
    "text": "(2) The Order made by the Minister undersubsection (1) shall be in operationimmediately upon the Minister affixing hissignature thereto.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      211.17,
      421.49,
      396.71,
      444.83
    ],
    "text": "(3) Every such Order shall as soon asconvenient be published in the Gazette.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "TimesNewRoman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      211.17,
      457.49,
      396.71,
      492.83
    ],
    "text": "(4) Every such Order shall as soon asconvenient thereafter, be approved by aResolution of Parliament.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      211.17,
      505.49,
      396.72,
      540.83
    ],
    "text": "(5) Where any such Order is not approved byParliament it shall be deemed to be rescindedwith effect from the date of such Resolution.\u201d.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      157.17,
      553.49,
      396.73,
